<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simartar" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5489226); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5489226&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579227329" alt="Simartar" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5489226)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/simartar" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5489226); return false;">Simartar</a></span> - Author of <a href="http://scp-wiki.net/scp-4527">SCP-4527</a><br />
