			<div class="content" id="post-content-4473582">
									

<p>Alright, I promised you guys a site crit once I got around to rereading, so here it is.</p>
<p>So, while the article is definitely <em>better</em> than when I critted it last week, I'm still finding myself rather unexcited by it. The entire concept of Spook, Mack, and Mick being three facets of the same personality is honestly reall cool, and your title tips me off about exactly how they were split by Fuller. That being said, this was just entirely too long. There was so much information here that I found myself skimming by the time I hit the UIU file. Really, the story that you guys tell here isn't all that complex, but there's a real slog of getting through minutiae and retreading old ground that stands in the reader's way. The pacing of this is really nonexistent, unfortunately.</p>
<p>The writing here was excellent and the concept is awesome, but the length really killed this one for me. I'm settled on a novote, but if the writing was any weaker, it'd have been a downvote.</p>
<p><span style="font-size:smaller;"><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> <em>Opinions expressed in this review do not reflect the opinions of SCP Wiki staff as a whole. Please respond to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4483018); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4483018&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579473246" alt="TheMightyMcB" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4483018)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4483018); return false;">TheMightyMcB</a></span> or contact the captain of the Site Criticism Team, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soullesssingularity" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(637830); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=637830&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579473246" alt="SoullessSingularity" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=637830)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soullesssingularity" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(637830); return false;">SoullessSingularity</a></span>, for any questions or concerns relating to this review.</em></span></p>

